\fBsearch\fR \fIWORD\fR [\fB\-\-run\fR \fIN\fR]
Find commands by word in every group (key, label, command, group). In the menu: \fB/\fR\fIword\fR, \fB?\fR\fIword\fR, \fBn\fR, \fBN\fR.
.TP
\fBlist\fR
Every menu item with its key and command.
.TP
\fBrun\fR \fIKEY\fR [\fIVALUE\fR...]
Run one menu item by key.
.TP
\fBmenu\fR
Open the menu (same as no command).
.TP
\fBcompletion bash\fR
Print a bash completion script: \fBeval "$(familia completion bash)"\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR, \fB\-n\fR
Before the command: print the exact command (and the license review it would run) and run nothing. After the command it is passed to the script, which then does its own dry run.
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR, \fB\-y\fR
Accept the license review without a prompt. The summary is still printed.
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR, \fB\-h\fR
Help for familia, or after a command for that command.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\fR, \fB\-\-run\fR \fIKEY\fR, \fB\-\-search\fR \fIWORD\fR, \fB\-\-pipe\fR
The menu's own options (see familia\-menu.sh \-\-help).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBFAMILIA_COLOR\fR
auto (default), always or never: highlighting of search matches.
.TP
\fBNO_COLOR\fR
When set, no colors or highlighting anywhere.
.TP
\fBFAMILIA_ACCEPT_LICENSES\fR
yes accepts the license review without a prompt (the summary is still printed); same as \-\-yes.
.TP
\fBFAMILIA_ACCEPT_UNKNOWN_LICENSES\fR
yes also accepts licenses that could not be determined.
.TP
\fBFAMILIA_LICENSE_ACCEPT_FILE\fR
Where license acceptance is recorded (default .cache/familia/license\-acceptance.json).
.TP
\fBFAMILIA_NO_TTY\fR
1 makes the menu behave as if there were no terminal (print the items, exit 2).
.TP
\fBFAMILIA_MENU_PIPE\fR
1 lets menus read choices from a pipe.
.TP
\fBFAMILIA_GRAPH\fR
Graph file to use instead of graph.yaml, where the script supports it.
.TP
\fBFAMILIA_HOSTS_OVERLAY\fR
Path to hosts.local.yaml connection overlay (#104); default ~/.config/familia/hosts.local.yaml.
.TP
\fBPYTHON\fR
Python interpreter (default python3).
.TP
\fBPAGER\fR
Pager for the quick start and other text (default more).
.TP
\fBHF_TOKEN\fR
Hugging Face token for gated models. Read from the environment only; never printed or written to logs.
.TP
\fBGITHUB_TOKEN\fR
Used by llama_flags.py for GitHub API limits when set; never printed.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fIgraph.yaml\fR
The declarative graph: hosts, nodes, models, agents, skills, Harness2 settings.
.TP
\fIscripts/menu\-items.txt\fR
The menu table. The menu, this command and this page are generated from it.
.TP
\fIscripts/cli\-commands.txt\fR
Subcommand names for familia(1).
.TP
\fIskills/catalog.json\fR
The bundled skills catalog (green\-zkillz).
.TP
\fI.cache/familia/license\-acceptance.json\fR
Recorded license acceptance (selection hash and license set).
.TP
\fI.cache/familia/model\-license\-acceptance.json\fR
Per\-model license acceptance for downloads.
.TP
\fI~/.local/bin/familia\fR
The 2\-line shim familia install\-cli writes ($XDG_BIN_HOME; Termux $PREFIX/bin) that runs this checkout's familia.
.TP
\fI~/.local/state/familia/installed.txt\fR
Every file familia install\-cli wrote; familia uninstall\-cli removes exactly those.
.TP
\fI~/.local/state/familia/monitor\-events.jsonl\fR
Monitor event log (deaths, OOM kills).
.TP
\fIregistry/models/\fR
The model database, one JSON file per model file.
.TP
\fIpins.txt\fR
Pinned sub\-projects that scripts/configure.sh checks out.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
0
Success, or for search: something matched.
.TP
1
The command failed, the licenses are not accepted, the item is not available yet, or nothing matched a search.
.TP
2
Usage error: unknown command or option, a missing required value, or no terminal for a menu or prompt.
.TP
3
License review: a license could not be determined and was not explicitly accepted.
.PP
Otherwise the exit status of the command that ran.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
familia                              # the menu
familia help serve                   # what \(aqfamilia serve\(aq runs
familia \-\-dry\-run serve coder         # print the command, run nothing
familia licenses review              # every license you would be subject to
familia skills enable green\-probe \-\-dry\-run
familia model fetch Qwen/Qwen2.5\-0.5B\-Instruct\-GGUF Q4_K_M \-\-dry\-run
familia hermes \-\-model coder          # hermes on one model
familia hermes \-\-graph\-mode          # hermes on the whole graph
familia harness2 set hermes propose
familia monitor \-\-once
familia search license
.fi
